  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 702d2e93d0a019a40b6339daf41e2c2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: WhatTheLandAsks
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: whatthelandasks
  displayName: What the Land Asks
  description: A lit stone has to be held. Do what a held land asks of you, lay a Pact Rune in its stone, and make it Secure.
  chain: The Haven's Reach
  journalNotes: 'A lit stone is a promise, and the forest will test it. A held land wears a little at every dawn and at the end of every raid, faster under blight. Below 25 it is slipping; at nothing the forest takes it back.


    Each held land asks something now and then: to hunt, gather or fish in it. Its stone and the Lands tab say what. A Pact Rune laid in its stone adds a good deal more, and each of its places you find adds a little.


    From a hold of 70 a land is Secure: it sends what it grows home to the stash at every dawn, and the corrupted nights will not come through it.'
  rank: 4
